        "id": "E0",
        "kind": "feed",
        "text": "We’re rolling out voice and expressive avatars in the Muse app, giving you a new way to interact with your Muse. The post Give Your Muse a Voice appeared first on Meta Newsroom .",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/11/introducing-muse-ai-voice-expressive-avatars/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T18:30:58.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-07T16:22:49.270Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E1",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "We’re rolling out voice and expressive avatars in the Muse app, giving you a new, natural way to interact with your Muse.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/11/introducing-muse-ai-voice-expressive-avatars/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T18:30:58.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-07T16:22:49.270Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E2",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Voice helps you think out loud, making tasks like brainstorming, trip planning, or rehearsing for an interview easier.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/11/introducing-muse-ai-voice-expressive-avatars/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T18:30:58.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-07T16:22:49.270Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Voice means Muse goes with you — say what needs to get done while on a walk or when your hands are full, and Muse handles it in the background as you talk.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/11/introducing-muse-ai-voice-expressive-avatars/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T18:30:58.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-07T16:22:49.270Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Your Muse’s avatar reacts as it listens and speaks, with expressions and gestures that match the conversation.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/11/introducing-muse-ai-voice-expressive-avatars/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T18:30:58.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-07T16:22:49.270Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "At Connect 2026, we previewed real-time conversations with your Muse.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/11/introducing-muse-ai-voice-expressive-avatars/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T18:30:58.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-07T16:22:49.270Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Now we’re rolling it out in the Muse app on mobile, web and on Mac — just tap the phone icon in the top-right corner to start talking.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/11/introducing-muse-ai-voice-expressive-avatars/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T18:30:58.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-07T16:22:49.270Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "With voice, you can talk through an idea with your Muse and let it take shape without worrying about the exact prompt.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/11/introducing-muse-ai-voice-expressive-avatars/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T18:30:58.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-07T16:22:49.270Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Start with the half-baked idea: the city you’ve always wanted to see, the kind of place you’d want to wake up in, the one meal you’d plan the rest of the trip around.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/11/introducing-muse-ai-voice-expressive-avatars/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T18:30:58.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-07T16:22:49.270Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Give your Muse a voice with some personality.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/11/introducing-muse-ai-voice-expressive-avatars/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T18:30:58.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-07T16:22:49.270Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Our Muse Realtime Avatar and Muse Realtime Voice technology lets you have fluid conversations in real time.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/11/introducing-muse-ai-voice-expressive-avatars/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T18:30:58.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-07T16:22:49.270Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Voice and expressive avatars are rolling out now in the Muse app in the US to start.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/11/introducing-muse-ai-voice-expressive-avatars/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T18:30:58.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-07T16:22:49.270Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E12",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Voice conversations with your Muse are coming soon to AI Glasses and Muse Charm.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/11/introducing-muse-ai-voice-expressive-avatars/",
